    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d545">

                <pb facs="0538" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg526"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.51A/598: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-05-05T17:00:00+03:25">May 5, 1943—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 8:19 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>466. Medjliss yesterday passed law granting Millspaugh powers substantially as
                    outlined in my 385, April 14. Full text being sent by air mail.<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d545-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
